Storage debug utilities

This image runs bounded fio and ioping checks against an existing writable
mount. It never uses an unbounded workload. Read the runbook before use:
https://github.com/telekom/k8s-breakglass/tree/main/utils/images/storage-debug

Defaults: 16 MiB, 5 seconds, 5 ioping requests. Configure STORAGE_TEST_PATH
and the STORAGE_TEST_* variables for a generic mount appropriate to your pod.
Existing files are never selected as fio scratch storage and report paths are
never overwritten. Reports stay beneath STORAGE_REPORT_DIR (default /reports).
